I found a little problem when I tried to compile nethack 3.0, patch 4.
Problem is:
	objects.c includes decl.h
	decl.h includes pm.h and onames.h
	objects.c is used to create makedefs
	makedefs creates pm.h and onames.h
So, objects.c needs pm.h and onames.h to create pm.h and onames.h...
As I said, a minor difficulty. But perhaps worth removing.

(I copied pm.h and onames.h from older files. But that certainly isn't
very elegant. :)
